<title>USA: Wolverine Tube Inc Q3 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Wolverine Tube Inc Q3 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTSVILLE, Ala. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						Three-Month Periods Ended</p>
<p>					     Sep 28,		Sep 30,</p>
<p>						 1996		    1995</p>
<p> Net sales			   $   168,653	   $  159,914</p>
<p> Net income				  9,580		  6,989</p>
<p> Net income per common share	    0.67		   0.49</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of common and</p>
<p>   common equivalent shares	   14,215		 14,189</p>
<p>						Nine-Month Periods Ended</p>
<p>					     Sep 28,		Sep 30,</p>
<p>						 1996		    1995</p>
<p> Net sales			   $   528,346	   $  504,123</p>
<p> Net income				 30,277		 25,048</p>
<p> Net income per common share	    2.12		   1.76</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of common and</p>
<p>  common equivalent shares	    14,191		 14,099</p>
<p>1995 Q3 includes a charge of $685,000, or $0.05 a share related to a secondary offering.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
